<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">WHO WE HELP</span>
    <h1>If any of this sounds familiar, we should talk.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Rhemroyal works with a range of organisations at different stages. What they tend to have in common is ambition that has outpaced structure.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section white">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="audience-grid">
      <article class="audience-card">
        <h3>Startups & Founders</h3>
        <p>You have a genuine idea and the drive to build it, but no formal plan, structure or strategy behind it yet.</p>
        <ul class="signal-list">
          <li>You're still explaining the idea differently every time someone asks</li>
          <li>You haven't written a business plan, or the one you have feels theoretical</li>
          <li>You're making big decisions without a sounding board</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="audience-card">
        <h3>Emerging Organisations</h3>
        <p>You're past the idea stage — there's a team, some traction, maybe early clients — but the foundations were never formalised.</p>
        <ul class="signal-list">
          <li>Roles and responsibilities are unclear or overlapping</li>
          <li>Decisions rely on one or two people's memory, not documented process</li>
          <li>Growth feels chaotic rather than deliberate</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="audience-card">
        <h3>Growing Businesses & Teams</h3>
        <p>The business is working, but the systems that got you here are now creating friction, not removing it.</p>
        <ul class="signal-list">
          <li>The team has grown faster than your processes</li>
          <li>Meetings and reporting have multiplied without adding clarity</li>
          <li>You need a growth roadmap, not just more hours in the week</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="audience-card">
        <h3>Community & Social Impact Initiatives</h3>
        <p>Your mission is clear, but turning that mission into planned, measurable impact is the harder part.</p>
        <ul class="signal-list">
          <li>You're volunteer-led or informally structured and want to formalise</li>
          <li>You need an impact plan to support a funding or partnership conversation</li>
          <li>You want a way to actually measure the difference you're making</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section pale">
  <div class="container two-col">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">BEING UPFRONT</span><h2>When we might not be the right fit.</h2></div>
    <div>
      <p>We'd rather tell you this now than after a consultation. Rhemroyal isn't a law firm, accountancy practice or regulated financial adviser — if you need formal legal, tax or regulated financial advice, we'll point you toward someone qualified to give it, and can work alongside them on the strategy and planning side.</p>
      <p>We're also built for organisations that want an ongoing working relationship, not a one-off document with no support to implement it. If that's genuinely all you need, we're happy to say so.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

